The stable module needs one standards fix before I can call the local build complete: its polynomial witness currently uses `[coefficient, exponent]`, but this task explicitly requires rationals as `[num,den]` and monomials as exponent lists. I’m converting the answer boundary to canonical `[[num,den],[exponent]]` terms while keeping the internal exact arithmetic unchanged, then I’ll rerun all gates.
