+        "squares, so a difference-of-squares decomposition replaces generic "
+        "exact factorization."
+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: exact Q[t] factorization is polynomial-time via LLL; the "
+        "measured reference is classical Berlekamp factorization modulo 3 "
+        "plus degree-balanced lifting, O(D^3+2^r D^2), which at shipping "
+        "degree 140 took a median 1,143,973 field operations and 0.450 s "
+        "over eight seeds; the residue-square route took 247 operations."
+    ),
+    "max_answer_tokens": 41,
+}
+
+NATIVE: dict = {
+    "domain": PROBLEM_PROFILE["native_domain"],
+    "core": PROBLEM_PROFILE["computational_core"],
+    "objects": list(PROBLEM_PROFILE["native_objects"]),
+    "intuition": (
