      0 & 0   & \cdots & 0       & 0                   & \frac{2}{n-k+3}                       & \frac{b_{k-2}}{b_{k-3}} & 0 & \cdots & 0 \\
      \vdots & \vdots & & \vdots & \vdots & \ddots & \ddots & \ddots & \ddots & \vdots \\
