codex
The hardened construction now passes targeted exact checks at every preset. At shipping size it uses a degree-144 derivative, a fixed 24-coefficient witness encoding, and a 241-operation compact route; a generic modular factorization takes roughly 11–13 million counted field operations and several seconds. I’m running the full 200,000-sample and eight-seed gate suite now.
