All local gates pass on the hardened family: 0/200,000 guesses, four attacks at 0/8, exact demo count 2/14,406, 60/60 canonical-symmetry checks, 11,049,990 median reference operations versus 240 for the compact route, and a 25-atom answer. I’m probing the revised easy rung against the oracle before committing to the full ladder.
