-  that has noticed the residue classes; that solver should use the compact
-  route and succeed.
-- The executable Berlekamp reference uses a good prime deliberately ensured by
-  construction and a coefficient-height-one lift. The general polynomial-time
-  fact is supplied by rational LLL factorization, not by a worst-case claim for
-  this particular lift implementation.
-- The solver sees the theorem-licensed polynomial coordinate model, not the
