The solved replies reveal exactly how the pool is succeeding: it reconstructs the small degree-4 compressed fourth roots and writes the three blocks. Increasing that compressed degree would be the natural hardness axis, but the next value already raises the intended exact work from about 240 to 360 operations, over G9(c)’s 300-operation cap. There is no honest remaining axis in this construction that grows the no-tool challenge while preserving the caps.
